{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01113No9fnoP7pktHKdSreEN", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# Latest Python Releases\n\n## Current Stable Release\n\n**Python 3.14.8** is the latest stable version, released on **September 30, 2026**. This is described as being in \"bugfix\" maintenance status with support extending through October 2030.\n\n## Other Notable Current Releases\n\nSeveral Python versions currently receive active maintenance:\n\n- **Python 3.13** (released October 7, 2024) - in \"security fixes only\" mode, supported until October 2029\n- **Python 3.12** (released October 2, 2023) - in \"security fixes only\" mode, supported until October 2028\n- **Python 3.11** (released October 24, 2022) - in \"security fixes only\" mode, supported until October 2027\n\nAdditionally, **Python 3.15 is in pre-release development**, with a planned release date of October 1, 2026 and support extending through October 2031.\n\nPython 3.10 reached end-of-life status on October 1, 2026, with 3.10.22 being its final release."}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-04T20:02:37.121Z", "tool_use_result": {"bytes": 217897, "code": 200, "codeText": "OK", "result": "# Latest Python Releases\n\n## Current Stable Release\n\n**Python 3.14.8** is the latest stable version, released on **September 30, 2026**. This is described as being in \"bugfix\" maintenance status with support extending through October 2030.\n\n## Other Notable Current Releases\n\nSeveral Python versions currently receive active maintenance:\n\n- **Python 3.13** (released October 7, 2024) - in \"security fixes only\" mode, supported until October 2029\n- **Python 3.12** (released October 2, 2023) - in \"security fixes only\" mode, supported until October 2028\n- **Python 3.11** (released October 24, 2022) - in \"security fixes only\" mode, supported until October 2027\n\nAdditionally, **Python 3.15 is in pre-release development**, with a planned release date of October 1, 2026 and support extending through October 2031.\n\nPython 3.10 reached end-of-life status on October 1, 2026, with 3.10.22 being its final release.", "durationMs": 4074, "url": "https://www.python.org/downloads/"}}
